# Protagonist, side view (faces right; mirror in the engine for left).
# 24x32 frames, feet on the bottom row. Holds a flashlight forward.
# art v2 (2026-11-22): idle, walk and jump are the ARCANUM XXII pixel works redesign;
# the other frames were rebuilt from them (private/tools_private/platformer_redesign_import.py).
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 24 32
@output ../characters/protagonist_side.png
@preview ../previews/protagonist_side_x6.png 6
@columns 7

